<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Biomet upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Biomet upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dain Bosworth analyst Rachael Scherer said she upgraded Biomet Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the medical devices maker were off 3/8 to 14-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
